								<ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[-- ROBLOX upstream: https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/0cf22a56a18790ef34c71bef14f64695c0498619/packages/react/src/ReactNoopUpdateQueue.js
--[[*
